{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2023-05", "window": 1, "start_date": 1682899200, "end_date": 1685577599, "month_true_total": 17, "quota": 17, "returned": 17, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:09:19 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "139257019", "author": {"steamid": "76561199018499949", "personaname": "Professor Doodlewacker", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/7958696i65gcdc/", "num_games_owned": 173, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 197, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 197, "last_played": 1685292328, "avatar": "fe0a0fa9590635dc47e69121546b740a42c4e77d"}, "language": "english", "review": "No updates 😂", "timestamp_created": 1685438644, "timestamp_updated": 1685438644, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.499536603689193726", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "139190088", "author": {"steamid": "76561198085519132", "personaname": "Captain Roman S'Jet", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198085519132/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 84, "playtime_forever": 155, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 155, "last_played": 1551642407, "avatar": "9cd3a52e644f77e86f0ce93fa336c28c3ce23595"}, "language": "english", "review": "nah", "timestamp_created": 1685327369, "timestamp_updated": 1685327369, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.357840448617935181", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138994748", "author": {"steamid": "76561197977503134", "personaname": "kodysandwich", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kodysandwich/", "num_games_owned": 1016, "num_reviews": 98, "playtime_forever": 471, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 471, "last_played": 86400, "avatar": "004043b5282377ac5223eb104319f1204c5d179f"}, "language": "english", "review": "This one ruled. Just remembered it.", "timestamp_created": 1685064123, "timestamp_updated": 1685064123, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.564446926116943359", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138975819", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042354809", "personaname": "Mayakii 🌿", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MistwalkerMayakii/", "num_games_owned": 232, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 4276, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2854, "last_played": 1702759484, "avatar": "270e06a4d19fa1bdec74744834de617e9745ac7d"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1]Review[/h1]\n[b]tl;dr[/b]\nAn addictive, fun, short game that can be enjoyed both with friends & solo! Because the game is old, it is sometimes difficult to find players. Achievement hunters beware - soloing is doable, but it will be a time investment. \n\n[b]Gameplay[/b]\nThere is only one campaign that offers 7 short levels (avg. 3 minutes long), and 4 specializations split between 8 characters that have unique traits, allowing you to build some fun load-outs.\n\nThe game is not difficult on easy and normal difficulties, but the higher settings will significantly increase the challenge as monsters will become a lot faster, will deal more damage while having more HP & the insane and brutal difficulties will spawn additional aliens throughout each level. \n\nYou can further enhance the difficulty by enabling \"onslaught\" mode, which will spawn waves of enemies, and a setting to toggle friendly fire to \"hardcore\" difficulty, which will make you take full damage from your teammates.\n\n[b]Achievements[/b]\nMost of the achievements you will acquire by simply playing the game while trying out different characters and weapons.\n\nThe most difficult and time-consuming achievements will be the ones that require you to complete the game on brutal difficulty and also the speed run ones. \n\nBrutal achievements are doable solo, but you will have an easier time with competent randoms or friends.\n\nFor speed run achievements, would recommend doing it solo as with \"assault jets\" you're able to save a lot of time by flying over walls, gaps, etc.\n\n[h1]Quick guide on how to acquire Team Fortress 2 parasite hat [b]solo[/b][/h1]\nThis is a quick written guide on how you can acquire your Team Fortress 2 Parasite hat without the need of connecting with randoms/friends by simply spawning in some bots in an online lobby. Your task is quite simple - complete only 2 maps/missions.\n\n[b]Enable developer console:[/b]\nTo be able to add bots to your online game, you first need to enable the console:\nOptions -> Keyboard/Mouse -> tick \"Enable developer console\". The default key will be \"~\", but can be changed in the same settings screen, located at the very bottom.\n\n[b]Creating lobby:[/b]\nPlay online -> Create game -> Set \"Permissions\" to \"Friends-only Game\" and leave everything else default -> Create game.\n\n[b]Adding bots to the lobby:[/b]\nChoose any character you would like to play (will recommend Wildcat, as she's my favorite).\nOpen the console and execute these 3 lines one after another by pressing enter to confirm:\n[code]cl_selectm 2 -1\ncl_selectm 7 -1\ncl_selectm 0 -1[/code]\nThese commands will add 3 different bot characters to your room. \n\nYou're now able to start the mission.\n\nIf you die while trying to acquire the two completed maps, I would recommend just restarting the mission by typing this command in the console:\n[code]asw_restart_mission [/code]\nA countdown of 5 seconds will start and the mission will fail. Simply click \"next\" and then \"Restart\" to go back to the pre-game game lobby.\n\nSome bot notes:\nYou can instruct bots to drop health with the number 2 (by default, if you followed my bot adding instructions) if you need healing;\nIf you're not a tech, approach any console or door and press \"F\" (by default) to make your tech engage in a hack.\nIf the bots stop following you for whatever reason, hold the letter \"Z\" (by default) and select \"Follow me\".\n\nGood luck and have fun!\n\nEDIT:\nIf you're an achievement hunter and struggling with some achievements, feel free to get in touch with me and I'll help you get it all done <3", "timestamp_created": 1685036901, "timestamp_updated": 1688659952, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.635506093502044678", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 22, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "138883469", "author": {"steamid": "76561199076720272", "personaname": "scullbone2007", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199076720272/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 83, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 32, "last_played": 1684946015, "avatar": "ee156c369a4e7334a35389abfa34c11195e94e3f"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game looks fun to play with friends. Altho i came here for the hat from tf2 i still like it, i wish ppl still plays more because there are no servers on it", "timestamp_created": 1684900179, "timestamp_updated": 1684